<v Kelly Hoover>--Boggle. And so then we end up starting to play this Boggle game and other people come by. Like--
<v Kelly Hoover>——Boggle。所以我们最终开始玩这个Boggle游戏，其他人也过来了。比如——

00:24:37.650 --> 00:24:41.460
<v Girl 1>These two guys from Virginia.
<v Girl 1>这两个来自弗吉尼亚的家伙。

